Result 1

Title

Enabled Finacle platform modernization, security remediation and monitoring enhancements across 15+ environments supporting resiliency, compliance and operational stability

Description

Supported multiple strategic platform initiatives for the Finacle banking platform with focus on resiliency, security compliance and operational stability across 15+ non-production environments. Contributed to CSSA 2025 remediation activities by supporting planning, deployment and testing across Dev, Perf and ESQM regions to close three identified risks. Designed and provided inputs for Ansible-based automation covering MFA and NNE related configuration deployments, reducing manual effort and environment inconsistencies. Supported FIS Active-Active ATM/POS enablement activities and SSB server refresh initiatives, including decommissioning support for legacy physical infrastructure post migration. Deployed and maintained PHP tools required by CBR teams in Dev and Perf regions. Contributed to Datadog custom metrics implementation by testing metrics in the RHELCERT region and supporting production rollout. Also migrated custom scripts, monitors and metrics from Python 3.6.8 to Python 3.12 across preproduction environments to align with COF standards.

Impact

Improved platform resiliency, compliance readiness and deployment consistency across environments. Reduced manual effort, accelerated remediation timelines and strengthened monitoring visibility while supporting stable execution of critical modernization initiatives.

