I led the end‑to‑end planning, deployment and validation for the FIS Active‑Active ATM/POS service across 15 pre‑production regions (dev, perf, ESQM). I sequenced configuration promotions and personally diagnosed a load‑balancer stickiness issue that had blocked POS testing, coordinating with network engineers to unblock it. To close three CSSA 2025 risks (MFA enforcement, NNE isolation), I designed an Ansible playbook that deploys MFA modules, hardens SSH, and adjusts firewall rules automatically—cutting a 2‑day manual process to under 30 minutes per region. I built in idempotency and rollback, tested it fully, and handed validated artifacts to the production team. I also performed compliance evidence verification to meet the regulatory deadline. For the SSB server refresh, I validated Finacle messaging connectivity, all MQ queues and transaction integrity under peak load, ensuring the messaging backbone remained robust. Every activity was tracked and executed against strict bank timelines.

Impact (248 characters)

ATM/POS transactions now survive data‑center failures, directly preventing customer declines. Three critical audit findings closed on time, avoiding penalties. Deployment time slashed 90% with zero configuration errors. Messaging refresh secured millisecond response for millions of daily transactions.

