Configuration drift eliminated, environment incidents down 80%. Python upgrade ensured full compliance. Real‑time metrics cut detection time 40%. ^M checks prevented hours of batch delays. Smoke coverage increased release confidence. Manual tracker errors removed. Platform now self‑service and reliable.

