Impact (244 characters)

100% uptime, zero unplanned outages. All security vulnerabilities remediated within SLA. No certificate or account expiry caused service disruption. Deposits migration went live flawlessly. Alert noise reduced 60%, speeding mean‑time‑to‑respond and reducing engineer burnout.

